Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 04:04:47 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1425/1463] HERESY 1486, 1487: the take's tree in the chain's
 order; its own players (the top half of the wave, the whole under the
 pointer)

1486: each branch under the branch its source lies in, indented by its depth; siblings keep the lab's order (the newest first); a branch whose source is gone at the top.
1487: every sound of the tree plays from a round button beside its wave: the top half on its line, the whole wave about its middle under the pointer, the played part lit, a click seeks; waves from the engine (the take) and the lab's GET /peaks?name=&path= (any file of the tree, in blocks, kept by its stamp), asked when the row comes into sight; the row's own audio element, hidden, still sounds it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
